slayer-editor (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. (Closes: #000000)
    Qt 6 code editor with a tabbed interface, an embedded QTermWidget
    terminal dockable on any edge, F5 to compile and run (C, C++, Python,
    Rust, Go, JavaScript, Java and shell), Language Server Protocol
    diagnostics and completion, Debug Adapter Protocol debugging, a
    Kate-style split view and status bar, several color themes and an
    optional symbol display.

 -- Wyllian Bezerra da Silva <wyllianbs@gmail.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:00:00 -0300
